THIRD-PARTY ASSETS (the assets/ folder)

The MIT license above covers the project's own work: scenes, scripts,
shaders, materials, the generated audio (assets/audio, produced by
tools/gen_audio.py) and the documentation in docs/.

The assets/ folder also contains third-party content that ships under its
own, separate license. Each pack keeps its license file inside its folder:

  assets/Sushi Restaurant Kit - May 2023/   Quaternius, CC0 1.0 Universal
                                            (see LICENSE.txt in that folder)
                                            https://quaternius.com/packs/sushirestaurantkit.html

  assets/Ultimate Food Pack - Oct 2019/     Quaternius, CC0 1.0 Universal
                                            (see License.txt in that folder)
                                            https://quaternius.com/packs/ultimatefood.html

  assets/fonts/LilitaOne-Regular.ttf        Juan Montoreano, SIL Open Font
                                            License 1.1 (see OFL.txt in that
                                            folder)

Those licenses apply to those files regardless of the MIT license on the
rest of the repository.
